OL,2,ENew Release! pottendo-Pi1541 /         
OL,3,EWebserver for upload images & updates  
OL,5,CAntwort:  BStefan_h                    
OL,6,CComments: B384                         
OL,7,F                                       
OL,8,FHallo                                  
OL,10,FWie funktioniert das mit dem           
OL,11,FDirektdruck?                           
OL,13,CErster Beitrag:                        
OL,15,GHi Retro-Fellows,                      
OL,17,Gsupported by @znarF and @ILAH several  
OL,18,Gtests have been successful (Option A   
OL,19,Gand B HW) and I was motivated to add   
OL,20,Gsome more features in a brand new V1.10
OL,21,Gof my circle port of Pi1541:           
OL,23,G- D81 Images can be uploaded           
OL,24,D]FForum64.de RSS feed            (1/3) 
