OL,1,T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,G- static network configuration to speed
OL,4,Gup webserver startup (see ReadMe, how  
OL,5,Gto configure in options.txt)           
OL,7,G- healthMonitor on serial console is   
OL,8,Goff by default and can be enabled; when
OL,9,Genabled, temperature is displayed also 
OL,10,Gon the LCD                             
OL,12,G- some more information on webserver,  
OL,13,Gnicer formatting                       
OL,15,GGet it from here .                     
OL,17,GCredits as always to Steve, Rene and   
OL,18,GStephan for their exceptional projects!
OL,20,GFeedback is welcome, let me know what  
OL,21,Gyou're missing!                        
OL,24,D]FForum64.de RSS feed            (2/3) 
